From 7b06695ebb8cbca412a80ee5d84e4fd380dacbe0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alexandre Julliard <julliard@winehq.org>
Date: Fri, 15 May 2026 11:48:59 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 010/162] mmdevapi: Use a system thread for the audio driver
 timer loop thread.

Adapted for the fork's winepulse: the no-op timer loop is deleted and no timer thread is created, streams are processed from the PulseAudio main loop.

(partially picked from commit 4c3dd4e1d0e173e6be703ce3f05d123c0c476b1f)
